<title>UK: NatWest &quot;optimistic&quot; on Eurotunnel debt deal.</title>
<headline>NatWest &quot;optimistic&quot; on Eurotunnel debt deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Westminster Bank Plc, in negotiations to restructure the nine billion stg debt of channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc, said on Tuesday that negotiations continued but it was optimistic.</p>
<p>&quot;Negotiations continue and we are optimistic,&quot; a spokeswoman for NatWest told Reuters.</p>
</text>
